      "title": "200 Cybercabs in one batch put Tesla ahead of Waymo on Texas's robotaxi register, 1,507 to 1,321, as of 18 Nov",
      "summary": "Texas DMV records now list 1,507 Tesla Robotaxi vehicles, 773 of them Cybercabs, against Waymo's 1,321. A single batch of 200 Cybercabs with 2027 model-year VINs did it. Registered isn't the same as carrying riders.",
