      "image": "/assets/dispatch/tesla-gigafactory-nevada-2019.jpg",
      "title": "Tesla's Powercore puts a transformer, breaker and inverter in one box. First units run in 2027",
      "summary": "Tesla Energy's Powercore is a solid-state medium-voltage unit rated 7.4 MW that replaces a battery site's or data center's separate transformer and inverter. Tesla says first units operate in 2027; there's no price, factory or customer yet.",
