      "url": "/dispatch/tesla-giga-berlin-cybercab-factory.html",
      "image": "/assets/dispatch/giga-berlin-aerial-2023.jpg",
      "title": "Tesla's €3 billion Berlin hall is sized for 1 million Cybercabs a year. EU rules allow 1,500",
      "summary": "Tesla plans a new Cybercab building at Giga Berlin: about €3 billion, construction from early 2027, production in 2029, room for up to 1 million a year. It's a plan, and the EU still caps driverless cars at 1,500 per type a year.",
