      "title": "A Helsinki taxi firm bought 100 Model Ys to run on Tesla Assisted Driving, and says it will publish every time a driver steps in",
      "summary": "Menevä, a Finnish taxi company with more than 1,000 cars, is starting Robo Menevä in Helsinki: 100 Tesla Model Ys on Tesla Assisted Driving, a licensed \"host\" up front who stays legally responsible, and a public map of every takeover. Rides haven't started yet (as of 14 Nov 2026).",
